  - Renamed to Pumpkin Pizza (handwritten preference over printed title)
  - Allow canned pumpkin puree in place of frozen winter squash puree
  - Always use minced garlic, even with garlic naan
  - Regular paprika acceptable instead of smoked
  - Naan not restricted to whole wheat; Trader Joe's noted as good
  - Oven method only (skillet option removed)
